#: admin/inc/bptodo-welcome-page.php:15
msgid ""
"BuddyPress Todo List plugin allows BuddyPress members to add tasks to their "
"to-do list and allows them to ‘edit’, ‘delete’, ‘mark-complete’ their task. "
"Members can create the category for to-do and add to-do according to "
"category wise."
msgstr ""

#: admin/inc/bptodo-welcome-page.php:20
